WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:04,680
Miko, please help me carry it. I can't do it anymore.

2
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:08,040
She still can't bear to see me so tired

3
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:09,640
Thank you. Fortunately, I have you.

4
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:12,040
Otherwise, I don’t even know what to do.

5
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:14,240
How about you today? Just hang around me.

6
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:16,240
I ignored Song Jing

7
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:17,840
Just be polite

8
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:20,140
Maybe there will be a surprise

9
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:21,740
After all, Keke is also a girl

10
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:23,140
Carrying two bags is too heavy for her

11
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:24,140
I'd better do it

12
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,940
It was because of Miko that he helped me

13
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,770
Qian Mu also really likes Miko.

14
00:00:27,770 --> 00:00:28,770
Is she blind?

15
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:30,170
Miko is fat and ugly

16
00:00:30,170 --> 00:00:31,630
No matter where I went before

17
00:00:31,630 --> 00:00:33,630
I'm always the one who gets bullied by everyone.

18
00:00:33,630 --> 00:00:35,700
This time I turned out to be the foil

19
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:37,660
He also talked about this hater

20
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:42,190
Jingyi, what's wrong with you?

21
00:00:42,190 --> 00:00:43,320
Are you okay?

22
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:46,310
I think I twisted my foot

23
00:00:46,310 --> 00:00:49,900
Did I cause you any trouble?

24
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,700
It's okay, I can do it

25
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:56,300
Let's continue going up

26
00:00:56,300 --> 00:01:03,740
Don't hold on. I'll take you to the hospital.
